data: {"id": "c6b0de4cd0844e3f-thinking-parallel_evidence-786", "run_id": "c6b0de4cd0844e3f", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 证据采集结论（workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh, aiops-case-05）\n\n#### 1. 已确认事实（支持/限定原因的证据）\n| 维度 | 关键事实 |\n|------|----------|\n| **K8s Phase/Status** | `Pending`；`ContainersNotReady`；container `app` reason=`ContainerCreating`；restarts=0 |\n| **Metrics** | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=1` reason=`ContainerCreating`；无 Running/Succeeded/Failed 相位；kube_state_metrics 显示 phase Pending=1 |\n| **Events** | **`FailedCreatePodSandBox`** (multus plugin)；**`NoNetworkFound`**；根因明确指向：**NetworkAttachmentDefinitio", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789059736743, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

